==Old Norse==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gem-pro|non}} {{term/t|gem-pro|*hlaupaną}}, whence also Old English {{term/t|ang|hlēapan}} ( > English {{term|leap|lang=en}}), Old Saxon {{term/t|osx|hlōpan}}, Old Frisian {{term|hlapa|lang=ofs}}, Dutch {{term|lopen|lang=nl}}, Old High German {{term|hlaufan|lang=goh}} ( > German {{term|laufen|lang=de}}).

===Verb===
{{non-verb|hljóp|hljópu|hlaupinn}}

# to [[leap]], [[jump]], [[spring]]

